{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/12/09/5225451/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/12/09/5225451/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は、らりんとろってぃーと\nご飯食べに行ってきたよー( ﹡ˆoˆ﹡ )\nお腹空いてたからモリモリ食べました（笑）\n美味しかった〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もふ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/12/09/5225451/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒いのが苦手な私のために、\nスタッフさんがギンギラのやつを\nぐるぐる巻にしてくれました（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あったかかったです（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イエイ♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/12/09/5225451/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんのポーズか忘れた（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！おじいちゃんのポーズだ！( ･ิω･ิ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最高ー！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/12/09/5225451/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/12/09/5225451/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"反射しまくって、全っ然\nポスター映ってないや！ごめん（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『リボンの騎士』大千秋楽おめでとう！\n大阪まではいけなかったけど、\nいくちゃん、れいか、\n本当にお疲れさまでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/12/09/5225451/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/12/09/5225451/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんの隣確保"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/12/09/5225451/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてくっついてくる真夏( ¨̮  )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなわちゃわちゃしてる（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、目まぐるしく色んな事が\nありまして、毎日感謝です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色々と報告しなきゃいけないこと\n沢山あるんですが、ここいらで\nなんてことない日常ブログを\n上げてみました( ¨̮  ) 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、ここから、\nお知らせたくさんです( ﹡ˆoˆ﹡ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/12/09/5225451/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9日 (水)    ※本日！！！！\n＊『別冊CD&DLでーた My Girl vol.7』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊『ボム』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マイガールさんでは、\nお誕生日を迎えるにあたって、\nこれまでの人生を振り返りました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/12/09/5225451/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(他にも、蘭世が出てます！）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボムさんでは、生駒ちゃんと\nグラビアをさせて頂きました(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人的には、みかんを食べて\n「すっぱぁぁ｣ってなってる\n写真がお気に入りです（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人とも12月生まれなので、\nお誕生日も祝って頂き、\n本当に嬉しかったです( ﹡ˆoˆ﹡ )"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/12/09/5225451/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難うございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(かりんちゃん、純奈、ろってぃー、\nきぃちゃん、蘭世、らりん、みおな、まあやも出てます！）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/12/09/5225451/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"14日 (月)\n＊ 19:00〜20:54 TBS系\n『第48回日本有線大賞』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日は「両親に感謝する日｣と\n言ってきましたが、偶然にも\nこの日、お誕生日を迎えます。(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46が、このような番組に\n呼んで頂けて、本当に光栄です。*\n最早両親だけではなく、沢山の人や\n色々なことに、感謝しながら\nこの日を迎えたいと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/12/09/5225451/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16日 (水)\n＊ 19:00～21:54 フジテレビ系\n『2015FNS歌謡祭 THE LIVE』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/12/09/5225451/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"19日 (土)\n＊『PF（ポーカーフェイス） Vol.2』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかと表紙をさせて頂きました。\n普段のイメージとは全然違う\nメイクやファッションを\nぜひ見てください♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(かりんちゃん、ろってぃー、ゆったん、まいちゅん、蘭世、まあやも出てます！)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/12/09/5225451/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"24日 (木)\n＊ 『street Jack 2月号』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\"あの連載\" に登場させて頂きます(﹡ˆˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影時、牛乳が好きという雑談をしてたら、\n差し入れにわざわざ牛乳を\n買いに行ってくださって、\nさらに、美味しいとオススメの\n\"練乳鈴カステラ\"も\n買ってきてくださいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてたべたのですが、\nこの鈴カスと牛乳のコラボが\n堪らなく美味しいことを発見し、感動（笑）\nそのあとメンバーのみんなに、\n大量に持ち帰って差し入れしたら\n見事に完売でした！（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、少し早いお誕生日\nプレゼントも頂きました(  *ω*  )嬉"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に色々と感謝です！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/12/09/5225451/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/12/09/5225451/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(ななみんも出てます！)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/12/09/5225451/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"25日 (金)\n＊  19:00〜23:10 テレビ朝日系\n『MUSIC STATION SUPER LIVE 2015』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊ 『FLASHスペシャル』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フラッシュさんは、\n万理華と、ひめたんと、3人で、\nほのぼのした私たちらしい\nグラビアを撮っていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日、携帯電話と間違えて、\nテレビのリモコンを\n持ってきてしまいました（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色も大きさもだいぶ違うのに（笑）\n相当寝ボケながら準備してたのかな..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それにしても、そんな漫画みたいな\nボケ、本当にあるんだ！って\nみんなに笑われました。（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(飛鳥、まいやん、なぁちゃん、ななみん、さゆりん、かりんちゃん、純奈、きいちゃん、伊織、琴子、まいちゅん、絢音、蘭世、未央奈、れなち、みり愛たんも出てます！)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/12/09/5225451/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現在発売中！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊ 『日経エンタテインメント！ アイドル Special 2016』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(メンバー全員出てます！)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の方に読んで頂きたい1冊です。\nぜひ！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/12/09/5225451/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大切なお知らせ！！！\n＊「【最終章】學蘭歌劇『帝一の國』―血戦のラストダンス―」\nで、第一章、第二章に引き続き、\n日奈ちゃんとWキャストで\n「白鳥美美子｣を務めさせて\n頂くことが決定しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2016年3月17日（木）〜27日（日）\n東京・AiiA 2.5 Theater Tokyoにて\n上演されます！( ﹡ˆoˆ﹡ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さらに、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/12/09/5225451/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"18日(金)\n＊ 【第二章】學蘭歌劇『帝一の國』\n－決戦のマイムマイム－ 公演DVD\nが、発売されます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひぜひ、観てほしいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"動画もアップされています〜\n▼http://www.nelke.co.jp/chanelke/teiichinokuni02_digest/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂の番組の印象でしか\n私のことを知らない人に\nぜひ、観てほしいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/12/09/5225451/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/12/09/5225451/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/12/09/5225451/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とまぁそれももちろんなんですが、\n色んな所でメンバーみんなが\nたくさん活躍しているので、\nぜひ色々見てほしいな(,,^_^,,)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/12/09/5225451/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーハイスピ見に行かなきゃー\\(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/12/09/5225451/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/12/09/5225451/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/12/09/5225451/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆヽ(｡･ω･｡)正義"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/12/09/5225451/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}